        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第二盘，剧本重演：孙心然又是零比二开局。但这一次，第三局她立刻回破，没有给对手机会。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "061daf08e5fec1daad290605ff1d7caf6892b5dbb143353f0c3b9b6c17e7059d",
      "words_sha256": "248577fddfe848603e5d57d2b0438a7ead7b2096d28d5c1f5d01554a00f246a5"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:4e41a77064539758f71e3c92556751c79a8b23c15f9d0149f299386616841582",
      "request_id": "4e41a77064539758f71e3c92556751c79a8b23c15f9d0149f299386616841582",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "e9133384c8a44d3793d9a28ea39f73cd",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "七比六、六比二，孙心然拿下小组赛开门红。首盘一比四落后都能翻回来，抢七一个发球分都不给对手。十六岁，青年世界第一，主场首秀的第一份答卷。小组赛还有两场，你觉得，她在成都，能走多远？",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "db3f7371c174a26e5c7a76276e463d4ef3adf9428c4611d3413d6020535fa713",
      "words_sha256": "975c3d69050eb3ab63efb91a3a4e9a65b763fd0abfb79b5839b9d03d74900dc0"
    },
    {
      "id": "bundle:8f3daa3fd719d385b97ee3a2a61565a58c1bebb495324cb7a39b9347b9a2feb9",
      "request_id": "8f3daa3fd719d385b97ee3a2a61565a58c1bebb495324cb7a39b9347b9a2feb9",
      "request": {
        "backend": "edge",
        "cache_key": "7a8f76309776ed5af00d29a4ce15b2ef",
        "lead_pause": 0.0,
        "pitch": "+0Hz",
        "rate": "+6%",
        "style": "",
        "styledegree": "",
        "text": "第五局，破发点上，两人底线相持，茨维特科维奇占先区一侧回球出界，孙心然破发反超，三比二。第七局再破，五比二。这一盘，对手四个发球局，丢了三个。",
        "voice": "zh-CN-YunjianNeural"
      },
      "audio_sha256": "c1aa1a721bc4b142d8bf3d63554bf42920bb8a2456ff9ae2083754a9618b6635",
      "words_sha256": "62cd68285ef4d4e128eb36a666bd9ac588c6dc2ab62204d44bb0aff8e02b401e"
    },
